  "prefLabel": "Gcd 403.01 Application for Tag and Certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 403.01 Application for Tag and Certificate. Persons wishing to obtain a certificate or tag stamped, “G C D Permanent Registration” for their service animal, shall submit a written request to the commission which includes the owner’s:\n\n(a) Name;\n\n(b) Address;\n\n(c) Phone number;\n\n(d) Email address; and\n\n(e) City or town of residency.\n\nSource. #10341, eff 5-17-13; ss by #13811, eff 11-23-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gcd100-400.html"
}
